<title>BELGIUM: Fischler leads EU food trade team to Japan.</title>
<headline>Fischler leads EU food trade team to Japan.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Union Farm Commissioner Franz Fischler on Thursday will lead a 19-member food trade delegation to Tokyo in a bid to increase the EU's annual three billion Ecus food exports to Japan.</p>
<p>During the six-day visit Fischler will meet Japanese Agriculture Minister Takao Fujimoto, Foreign Minister Yukihiko Ikeda and open on March 11 an EU stand at the Foodex '97 exhibition in Tokyo.</p>
<p>&quot;Fischler has taken the initiative to highlight the need for food companies to become more active in the promotion and development of export markets,&quot; a European Commission statement said.</p>
<p>The EU delegation will focus on export opportunities for dairy products, meat and meat products, wines and spirits, horticultural products and olive oil.</p>
</text>
